      "text": "front - back - db\n\nGeneral requirements\n\nTechnical requirements\n\nModules\n\ngit workflow\n\ncontainerization\n\nGoogle Chrome\n\nPrivacy Policy / Terms of Service\n\n.env.example\n\nMulti-user Support\n\nclear front / responsive / multi devices\n\nCSS framework\n\nDB: clear schema and well-defined relations.\n\nUser management system\n\nInput validation front / back\n\nHTTPS\n\nFramework back & front\n\nMajor - 2pts - 8 - 16\n\nMinor - 1pts - 6 - 6\n\nTotal - 22pts\n\nAPI\n\nRemote Auth (OAuth 2.0 - Google, Github)\n\n2FA\n\nWAF/ModSecurity & ashiCorp Vault \n\nMonitoring - Prometheus and Grafana\n\nBackend as microservices\n\nModule of choice: Multi Language / API / Framework\n\nModule of choice: Figma\n\nAdvanced permissions system (RBAC)\n\nUser Management\n\nORM\n\nCustom-made design system\n\nAdvanced search functionality",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "front - back - db\n\nGeneral requirements\n\nTechnical requirements\n\nModules\n\ngit workflow\n\ncontainerization\n\nGoogle Chrome\n\nPrivacy Policy / Terms of Service\n\n.env.example\n\nMulti-user Support\n\nclear front / responsive / multi devices\n\nCSS framework\n\nDB: clear schema and well-defined relations.\n\nUser management system\n\nInput validation front / back\n\nHTTPS\n\nFramework back & front\n\nMajor - 2pts - 8 - 16\n\nMinor - 1pts - 6 - 6\n\nTotal - 22pts\n\nAPI\n\nRemote Auth (OAuth 2.0 - Google, Github)\n\n2FA\n\nWAF/ModSecurity & ashiCorp Vault \n\nMonitoring - Prometheus and Grafana\n\nBackend as microservices\n\nModule of choice: Multi Language / API / Framework\n\nModule of choice: Figma\n\nAdvanced permissions system (RBAC)\n\nUser Management\n\nORM\n\nCustom-made design system\n\nAdvanced search functionality",
      "autoResize": true,
